            "description": "API key for authentication (required).\n\n**API Key Format**: 32-character alphanumeric string\n**Required**: This parameter is mandatory for accessing rate limit information\n**Note**: Works with both active and expired API keys\n\n**Example**: `?api_key=your_api_key_here`",
